From 16bc4319a509e342f2dfa02803d6d585b89574bf Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Tommy <tommy@pham.cc>
Date: Thu, 29 Oct 2026 01:55:00 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 3/3] ps2xIOP: sound debug aids (env-gated)

TEKKEN4_SOUND_VOICES=1: every 5 s the sounding voices, libsd calls by ordinal, KON/KOFF writes,
SPU2 IRQs and EE commands delivered; the first IOP->EE SIF commands with their body words.
TEKKEN4_SOUND_SOLO=<core0 mask>,<core1 mask>: only those voices reach the mix (e.g. 0,f30000 =
zsiopdrv's stream voices). TEKKEN4_IOP_DUMP=<s>[,..]: IOP RAM + SPU RAM dumps at IOP seconds.
TEKKEN4_IOP_TRACE=<pc>[,..] (+ TEKKEN4_IOP_TRACE_MAX): a0-a3/ra each time the IOP reaches a PC.
Nothing changes without the variables.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 ps2xIOP/src/emulator/core/sound_engine.cpp |  36 ++++++-
 ps2xIOP/src/emulator/iop_emulator.cpp      | 104 +++++++++++++++++++++
 ps2xIOP/src/emulator/services/iop_rpc.cpp  |  15 +++
 3 files changed, 154 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)

